00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:26.790
Marukawa Publishing glossary!

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:27.810
Today's word is Phototypesetting.

00:23:27.810 --> 00:23:30.510
In phototypesetting, photography technology...

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:33.690
...is used to produce text on photosensitive paper.

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:35.840
In manga, this technology is used...

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.350
...mostly for the text and speech bubbles.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.530
One task is to glue the pieces on the page.
